Pencils ready? The crosswords on this and the next page are two of the six puzzles that challenged the finalists at GAMES's First U.S. Open Crossword Puzzle Championship, held August 14 at New York University. The contest time limits and winner's times are provided with the puzzles, in case you'd like to compare your skills. Copies of all six championship puzzles, and the answers, are available for $2. Write: Tournament Puzzles, GAMES Magazine, 515 Madison Ave., New York, NY 10022. A full report on the contest and
